    promptLabel: "文法形式選擇",
    instructionZh: "句中填空：依文脈選最自然的文法。",
    instructionI18n: { "en": "Fill in the blank: choose the grammar that fits the context most naturally." },
    promptText: "あの時にもう一度戻れる ___、彼にきちんと謝りたい。",
    promptContextZh: "如果可以再回到當時，我想好好向他道歉。",
    promptContextI18n: { "en": "If I could go back to that time once more, I'd want to apologize to him properly." },
