    promptLabel: "文法形式選擇",
    instructionZh: "句中填空：依文脈選最自然的文法。",
    instructionI18n: { "en": "Fill in the blank: choose the grammar that fits the context most naturally." },
    promptText: "苦情が百件を超える ___ 、会社はようやく調査委員会を設置した。",
    promptContextZh: "直到投訴超過一百件，公司才終於設立了調查委員會。",
    promptContextI18n: { "en": "Only after the complaints exceeded a hundred did the company finally set up an investigation committee." },
    hintZh: "投訴累積到一定數量後，公司才出現的動作。",
