    promptLabel: "文法形式選擇",
    instructionZh: "句中填空：依文脈選最自然的文法。",
    instructionI18n: { "en": "Fill in the blank: choose the grammar that fits the context most naturally." },
    promptText: "好調だった前期 ___ 、今期は受注が伸び、過去最高の売上を記録した。",
    promptContextZh: "比起本就暢旺的上一期，這一期接單更進一步成長，創下歷來最高的營收。",
    promptContextI18n: { "en": "Compared with the previous term, which was already thriving, orders grew even further this term, setting a record-high sales figure." },
