    instructionI18n: { "en": "Fill in the blank: choose the grammar that fits the context most naturally." },
    promptText: "彼女は、___、まず母に電話をかけて報告するのが常だった。",
    promptContextZh: "她不管是開心的時候還是難過的時候，總是習慣先打電話向母親報告。",
    promptContextI18n: { "en": "Whether she was happy or sad, she always made a habit of first calling her mother to report." },
