    promptText: "その程度の擦り傷は、製品の欠陥 ___ 。",
    promptContextZh: "那種程度的擦傷，還算不上是產品的瑕疵。",
    promptContextI18n: { "en": "A scratch of that degree hardly counts as a product defect." },
