    explanation: "考點為「Vる＋に＋同動詞可能形否定」的「言うに言えず」，意為「想說也說不出口」，後句「ずっと黙っていた」正與「說不出口而沉默」呼應，正解唯一。「言わずにはいられず」意為「忍不住要說」，與後句「一直沉默」語意相反；「言うまでもなく」意為「不用說、理所當然」，是補充說明的慣用語，無「說不出口」之義，且與「黙っていた」不搭；「言うにこと欠いて」意為「偏偏挑這種話來說（不該說的卻說了）」，反而是「說了」，與沉默矛盾。為免接續秒殺，四項皆為完整述語片語，須靠語意辨別，正解唯一。",
    explanationI18n: { "en": "The point tested is 「言うに言えず」, from the pattern \"dictionary-form V + に + potential negative of the same verb,\" meaning \"want to say it but can't get it out.\" The following clause 「ずっと黙っていた」 fits perfectly with \"couldn't say it, so stayed silent,\" leaving a single correct answer. 「言わずにはいられず」 means \"can't help but say it,\" the opposite of the following \"stayed silent the whole time\"; 「言うまでもなく」 means \"needless to say, of course,\" an idiom for adding a note, with no sense of \"can't say it,\" and it doesn't fit 「黙っていた」; 「言うにこと欠いて」 means \"of all things to say (saying something that shouldn't be said),\" which actually means one \"did say it,\" contradicting the silence. To keep the connection from giving it away instantly, all four are complete predicate phrases that must be told apart by meaning, and there is a single correct answer." },
