    explanationI18n: { "en": "「矛盾」 is read 「むじゅん」. 「矛」 has the on-reading む, and 「盾」 has the on-reading じゅん. The distractor 「むしゅん」 wrongly unvoices じゅ to しゅ; 「ぼうじゅん」 misreads 「矛」 as the similar-looking 「ぼう」; 「むじゅう」 wrongly stretches the final ん into a long vowel う—none is a valid reading of this word." },
