    explanationI18n: { "en": "The correct answer 「乙女（おとめ）」refers to an innocent young woman who longs for love, matching the youthful scene fixed by 「制服姿のまま／まだ恋に憧れる」(still in her uniform, still yearning for love). 「老女」means an elderly woman, contradicting the youthful setup; 「養女」means an adopted daughter, a term for a family relationship that doesn't fit the mirror-image scene; 「侍女」means a maidservant who waits on others, unrelated to this context. The only correct answer is therefore 「乙女」." },
