    explanationI18n: { "en": "「些細（ささい）な仕草」means a trivial little gesture, echoing the lyrical context of treasuring even the smallest of movements, and is the only correct answer. 「壮大」means grand and magnificent, which is opposite in meaning and an unnatural fit for the small 「仕草」; 「強烈」means intense and vivid, clashing with the gentle tone of 「胸の奥でそっと光っている」in the following clause; 「明白（めいはく）」means obvious and clear, whereas the context calls for something 'subtle,' not 'obvious.' All three distractors are unnatural when substituted in, and only 「些細」works." },
