    explanationI18n: { "en": "「なんて」, 「全く」, and 「心臓が跳ねた」 show that the outcome was unexpected, so the answer is 想定外. 予想通り ('as expected') contradicts the surprised, racing-heart reaction; 計画的 ('deliberately, by plan') can't apply since drawing lots is random and can't be planned; 想定内 ('within what was anticipated') is the opposite of a surprised reaction. So the only correct answer is 想定外." },
