    meaningZh: "身為～不該有的（言行/態度）",
    meaningI18n: { "en": "unbecoming of / inexcusable for someone in the role of ~ (behavior/attitude)" },
    promptLabel: "文法形式選擇",
    instructionZh: "句中填空：依文脈選最自然的文法。",
    instructionI18n: { "en": "Fill in the blank: choose the grammar that best fits the context." },
    promptText: "選手を導く立場のコーチが、負けたチームをあざ笑った。指導者___発言だとして、連盟は処分を検討している。",
    promptContextZh: "本該引導選手的教練竟嘲笑了輸球的隊伍。聯盟認為這是身為指導者絕不該有的發言，正研議處分。",
    promptContextI18n: { "en": "A coach whose job is to guide his athletes sneered at the losing team. The league, deeming it a remark utterly unbecoming of a mentor, is considering disciplinary action." },
