    hintI18n: { "en": "What precedes is the na-adjective stem 「未熟」, so choose an adversative-concessive form that can attach directly to a noun-like stem and express 'even lacking in ability, still making a positive effort.' Note that some connectives can only attach to the verb ます-form." },
