    hintZh: "前面接動詞可能形「戻れる」，後面是強烈的願望「～たい」，表示幾乎做不到的假設。",
    hintI18n: { "en": "It attaches to the potential form 「戻れる」, and what follows is the strong wish 「～たい」, expressing a hypothesis that is nearly impossible to achieve." },
    expectedAnswer: "戻れるものなら",
    options: ["戻れるものなら", "戻ったものの", "戻れるものを", "戻ったものだから"],
    explanation: "正解是「戻れるものなら」：可能形『戻れる』＋ものなら，後接願望『出会いたい』，正是表達幾乎做不到卻仍渴望的假設句型。「戻ったものの」=雖然回去了（逆接、承接已發生的事實），與後句願望不接、語意矛盾。「戻れるものを」=明明可以回去卻（責難惋惜，句末多搭のに，且須有實際可能性），與『再想相遇』的祈願不合。「戻ったものだから」=因為回去了（為某結果辯解原因），接的是事實非假設，無法承接『～たい』的願望。",
    explanationI18n: { "en": "The correct answer is 「戻れるものなら」: the potential form 『戻れる』 ＋ ものなら, followed by the wish 『出会いたい』, is exactly the pattern expressing a hypothesis that is nearly impossible yet still longed for. 「戻ったものの」 = although (I) went back (a concessive that follows an already-realized fact), which does not connect to the following wish and contradicts it. 「戻れるものを」 = even though (I) could go back, but... (reproach or regret, usually paired with のに at the end and requiring an actual possibility), which does not fit the yearning of 'wanting to meet again.' 「戻ったものだから」 = because (I) went back (justifying a cause for some result), which takes a fact rather than a hypothesis and cannot carry the wish of 『～たい』." },
